{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ終わったぁぁ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～～ほんとに楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事終えることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はたぶん、絶対一生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れられない日になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46初の単独ライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ZEPP大阪、名古屋と２日間"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさは今日が初ライブでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会とかで みなさんからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くライブが見たいなぁって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくお話しを聞いてて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから決まったときは本当に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくて嬉しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く言いたくて言いたくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つい言っちゃいそうで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我慢するの大変だった～(;O;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パフォーマンスでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省点は山ほどあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと練習したところを間違った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハじゃ間違わなかったところが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番じゃできなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のライブを披露できるのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日しかなくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一発勝負なのに悔しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけどステージから見る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragrap